// M times, run N taskgraphs constructs with id '0<=i<N' that spawns 3 tasks
//  T1 -> T2 -> T3
// Ensure that each taskgraph' structured block executed 0 to M times
// Ensure that each triplets executed precisely M times
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

